nylon-guitar|FreePats|acoustic-guitars|CC0 1.0|FreePats project (Spanish classical guitar)|freepats/spanish-classical-guitar|6f4eb1b092acc88f5448cea1a0001bd07b971af8|SpanishClassicalGuitar-20190618.sfz|Nylon Guitar|
ukulele|FreePats|acoustic-guitars|CC0 1.0|Mateusz Dąbrowski, for FreePats (Ukulele)|freepats/ukulele1|86d345f6f7b79a106ace98eca0da19b087786dba|Ukulele 20260811.sfz|Ukulele|
